                "text": "Voters sent a clear message to Trump on Tuesday: Enough of the costs, chaos, and corruption.\n\nAmericans wanted lower costs and instead got skyrocketing health care premiums, golden ballrooms and pardons for Trump\u2019s cronies.\n\nThe American people deserve better. https://t.co/gcCV2zRmOT",
